  "note": "EP73 Winter Storm Uri, Texas, February 2021. A control room of screens at twenty past one, a state where the heating is electric, a house giving up its warmth through walls built for July, a gas field freezing, and a bathtub. Nothing dramatises the cold and nothing dramatises death: the quarantine bars a collapse, a single villain and any toll but 246. The loudest object in the film is a list a gas plant was not on. MEASURED: 84 cues / 29.8 min = 2.81/min PASS."
